# National Oil Frontend - Setup Instructions

This is the Vue 3 SPA for the National Oil petrol station management system.

## Installation

1. Navigate to the frontend directory:
   ```bash
   cd apps/national_oil/frontend
   ```

2. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

3. Start development server:
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```

The app will be available at `http://localhost:5173`

## Build

To build for production:
```bash
npm run build
```

The output will be in the `dist/` directory.
